  "name": "Black Bean Chilli Fries",
  "subtitle": "Crisp sweet potato fries with smoky beans and bright toppings",
  "description": "A hearty vegetarian plate of sweet potato fries topped with smoky black bean chilli, feta, pickled onions, avocado, coriander, and lime.",
